# This file registers changes to the module.
# Please write in reverse order: the last version first.

Version 1.00:
	First publication.
Version 1.10:
        Modified some constants to avoid the unpredictable behavior 
        of sigunits when the digit juste after the one to be rounded 
        is exactly 5.
Version 1.11:
        Fixed a diacritic: "dûe" must be written "due".